{"3175180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trolling Bowling", "steam_appid": 3175180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trolling Bowling is everything you were told to never do at a bowling alley, except here you and your friends don't go to jail even when you push them in the way of oncoming balls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bowl as normal or don't! Hit the golden rings to earn trolling points and spend them to wrecking your friends' fun. Turn their pins to concrete, fill their lane with landmines, or fire a cannon at their ball. When they return the favor, upgrade your ball to fight back, or just throw a grenade and hope for the best. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/ec6ffea6e46364a12fd931c2c933a194.poster.avif?t=1778151279\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/ec6ffea6e46364a12fd931c2c933a194.webm?t=1778151279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/ec6ffea6e46364a12fd931c2c933a194.mp4?t=1778151279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trolling Powers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy troll powers with your points and ruin your opponents' turns. For machines, spring traps, landmines, cannons; there are a lot of ways to be a bad friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/11ab5fed9310a70ca86771575ddc347e.poster.avif?t=1778151279\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/11ab5fed9310a70ca86771575ddc347e.webm?t=1778151279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/11ab5fed9310a70ca86771575ddc347e.mp4?t=1778151279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Specialized Bowling Balls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Counter whatever your so called &quot;friends&quot; dare to throw at you. Did they turn your pins to concrete? There's a grenade ball for that. Upgrade, adapt, and make them regret starting the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/58e5bf6be0aad750d3e3fbae724cdf3d.poster.avif?t=1778151279\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/58e5bf6be0aad750d3e3fbae724cdf3d.webm?t=1778151279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/58e5bf6be0aad750d3e3fbae724cdf3d.mp4?t=1778151279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sabotage up to 7 friends with troll powers like wiggle goggles, windmills, kickballs, and many more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specialized bowling balls to counter your opponents' plans, including a grenade ball for desperate situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 player online multiplayer where its troll or be trolled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of whacky character models and swappable heads </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice mode to learn the counters before you face real opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Classic bowling mode for anyone who wants to play it straight (they won't last long)</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trolling Bowling is everything you were told to never do at a bowling alley, except here you and your friends don't go to jail even when you push them in the way of oncoming balls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bowl as normal or don't! Hit the golden rings to earn trolling points and spend them to wrecking your friends' fun. Turn their pins to concrete, fill their lane with landmines, or fire a cannon at their ball. When they return the favor, upgrade your ball to fight back, or just throw a grenade and hope for the best. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/ec6ffea6e46364a12fd931c2c933a194.poster.avif?t=1778151279\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/ec6ffea6e46364a12fd931c2c933a194.webm?t=1778151279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/ec6ffea6e46364a12fd931c2c933a194.mp4?t=1778151279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trolling Powers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy troll powers with your points and ruin your opponents' turns. For machines, spring traps, landmines, cannons; there are a lot of ways to be a bad friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/11ab5fed9310a70ca86771575ddc347e.poster.avif?t=1778151279\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/11ab5fed9310a70ca86771575ddc347e.webm?t=1778151279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/11ab5fed9310a70ca86771575ddc347e.mp4?t=1778151279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Specialized Bowling Balls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Counter whatever your so called &quot;friends&quot; dare to throw at you. Did they turn your pins to concrete? There's a grenade ball for that. Upgrade, adapt, and make them regret starting the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/58e5bf6be0aad750d3e3fbae724cdf3d.poster.avif?t=1778151279\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/58e5bf6be0aad750d3e3fbae724cdf3d.webm?t=1778151279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/extras/58e5bf6be0aad750d3e3fbae724cdf3d.mp4?t=1778151279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sabotage up to 7 friends with troll powers like wiggle goggles, windmills, kickballs, and many more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specialized bowling balls to counter your opponents' plans, including a grenade ball for desperate situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 player online multiplayer where its troll or be trolled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of whacky character models and swappable heads </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice mode to learn the counters before you face real opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Classic bowling mode for anyone who wants to play it straight (they won't last long)</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Sabotage your friends to win. Set Landmines, fire cannons, and replace their balls in this chaotic party game for up to 8 players. Troll or be trolled, no mercy, no gutter guards.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/header.jpg?t=1778151279", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/50bb9b95f8dac5d48bb1e95b2f905edb70fc9410/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778151279", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175180/50bb9b95f8dac5d48bb1e95b2f905edb70fc9410/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778151279", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4150 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia Geforce GTX 660 / AMD HD 7870 / Intel Arc A380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Travis Soules"], "publishers": ["Travis Soules"], "demos": [{"appid": 3518020, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 36, "description": "Online PvP"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps